{title: Easy A and D}
{artist: ChordCoach · Justin-style Stage 1}
{key: A}
{tempo: 80}
{time: 4/4}
{duration: 4}
{comment: Downstrum every beat: ONE two three four (↓ ↓ ↓ ↓). Same idea as Justin Guitar Stage 1 open-chord practice — only A and D.}

{start_of_verse}
{comment: Pattern — one bar each}
[A]ONE two three four  (↓ ↓ ↓ ↓)
[D]ONE two three four  (↓ ↓ ↓ ↓)
[A]ONE two three four
[D]ONE two three four
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
{comment: Two bars each — slower changes}
{duration: 8}
[A]Stay on A — ONE two three four · ONE two three four
[D]Stay on D — ONE two three four · ONE two three four
[A]Back to A — keep the downstrums steady
[D]End on D — ONE two three four · ONE two three four
{end_of_verse}
